OL,3,GNEWSASeaside themed play area opens in
OL,4,Acity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA play area has been revamped in a
OL,7,Fscheme designed to "create an inclusive
OL,8,Fspace for children to play", the
OL,9,Fcouncil says.
OL,11,FFormer ramps at the Medway Road site in
OL,12,FWorcester, which was used by people on
OL,13,Fbikes, scooters and skateboards, have
OL,14,Fbeen replaced with a coastal-themed
OL,15,Farea designed for children of all ages
OL,16,Fand abilities.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
