OL,3,GNEWSASeaside themed play area opens in
OL,4,Acity
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew features include a
OL,7,Fwheelchair-accessible roundabout,
OL,8,Fground-level trampoline, a large ship
OL,9,Fclimbing structure, a seaside mural,
OL,10,Fswings, and an octopus-shaped seesaw
OL,11,Fand slides.
OL,13,FIt was the third play area to reopen
OL,14,Fthis summer after refurbishment
OL,15,Fprojects, following work at Horizon Hub
OL,16,Fand Ronkswood Hub, the city council
OL,17,Fsaid
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
